+  <section class="section wrap problem-section" aria-labelledby="problem-title">
+    <div class="section-intro"><p class="section-number">01 / <span data-zh="问题与贡献">Problem & contribution</span></p><h2 id="problem-title" data-zh="移动底盘是一种位姿，不能直接当作三个关节。">A mobile base is a pose.<br>Not just three more joints.</h2><p data-zh="扩展动作维度只是第一步。真正需要打通的是：数据记录的坐标、模型学习的坐标，以及控制器执行的坐标。">Adding dimensions was only the first step. The real integration problem was aligning the coordinates in the dataset, the action space learned by the policy, and the targets consumed by the controller.</p></div>
+    <div class="contribution-list">
+      <article><span class="contribution-index">01</span><div><h3 data-zh="为底盘定义独立的数据模态">A dedicated base modality</h3><p data-zh="将末三维 (x, y, yaw) 拆为 chassis，保留前 22 维已有配置，并将状态与动作扩展为 25 维。">Separated the final (x, y, yaw) channels into a chassis modality, preserving the existing 22 channels and extending state and action to 25 dimensions.</p></div><span class="mono dim-tag">flat[22:25] → chassis</span></article>
+      <article><span class="contribution-index">02</span><div><h3 data-zh="为平面运动选择 SE(2) 表示">SE(2) for planar motion</h3><p data-zh="将目标位移旋转到当前车体系，并计算最短航向角差。手臂继续使用原有关节相对动作，底盘单独处理。">Rotated target displacement into the current base frame and encoded the shortest yaw difference. Arm channels retain their joint-relative representation; the base uses its own geometric transform.</p></div><span class="mono dim-tag">T₀⁻¹ Tₖ</span></article>
+      <article><span class="contribution-index">03</span><div><h3 data-zh="让训练编码与部署解码互为逆过程">An inverse path at deployment</h3><p data-zh="重新计算相对动作统计量，在推理端先反归一化，再用本次观测的参考位姿合成 ODOM 绝对目标，接入底盘控制接口。">Recomputed relative-action statistics, denormalized predictions, and composed them with the observation's reference pose to recover ODOM targets for the base controller.</p></div><span class="mono dim-tag">T₀ ΔT̂ₖ</span></article>
+    </div>
+  </section>
