+    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="section-number">02 / <span data-zh="端到端系统">The system</span></p><h2 id="pipeline-title" data-zh="同一份动作约定，贯穿两个方向。">One action contract.<br>Two directions.</h2></div><p data-zh="ODOM 提供参考位姿。策略学习相对目标。部署层负责恢复控制器需要的绝对目标。">ODOM provides the reference. The policy learns relative targets. The deployment layer reconstructs the absolute poses required by the controller.</p></div>
