+    <details class="implementation-detail"><summary><span data-zh="GR00T 内部：如何接入这套处理规则">Inside GR00T: where the adaptation lives</span><span class="detail-plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><div class="implementation-grid"><article><code>StateActionProcessor.apply_action</code><p data-zh="训练前将 chassis 目标编码为车体系相对量，再交给原有归一化路径；跳过普通 Joint 相对化。">Encode chassis targets in the base frame before the existing normalization path, while skipping generic joint-relative conversion.</p></article><article><code>StateActionProcessor.unapply_action</code><p data-zh="先用配套统计量反归一化，再将相对目标与观测参考位姿合成。">Denormalize with matching statistics, then compose relative targets with the observation's reference pose.</p></article><article><code>RelativeActionLoader</code><p data-zh="统计量生成使用同一套 SE(2) 编码规则，替换旧 chassis 相对统计量。">Generate statistics using the same SE(2) encoding and replace stale chassis-relative statistics.</p></article><article><code>--with-chassis-se2</code><p data-zh="通过独立启动入口显式启用底盘路径，保留手臂等通道的原有关节处理。">Opt in through a dedicated launcher while preserving the existing joint processing for arm and other channels.</p></article></div><p class="implementation-scope" data-zh="动作接口约定：本适配要求录制的 action.chassis 是 ODOM 期望目标位姿，单位为米/弧度；速度或未来实测状态属于不同的监督语义。">Action contract: this adaptation expects action.chassis to contain desired ODOM target poses in meters/radians. Velocity commands and future measured states have different supervision semantics.</p></details>
