+    <div class="runtime-diagram"><div class="runtime-column"><span class="runtime-badge" data-zh="GPU / 策略服务">GPU / POLICY SERVICE</span><h3 data-zh="将预测恢复成物理目标">Predictions → physical targets</h3><ol><li data-zh="读取带实时 ODOM 的观测快照">Receive observation with live ODOM</li><li data-zh="预测归一化的相对动作 chunk">Predict normalized relative action chunk</li><li data-zh="用匹配的 SE(2) 统计量反归一化">Denormalize with matching SE(2) statistics</li><li data-zh="用本次观测 T₀ 合成绝对目标">Compose absolute targets with snapshot T₀</li></ol><code>action["chassis"] → ODOM (x*, y*, yaw*)</code></div><div class="runtime-bridge" aria-hidden="true">→</div><div class="runtime-column"><span class="runtime-badge client" data-zh="机器人 / 客户端">ROBOT / CLIENT</span><h3 data-zh="将目标交给底盘控制器">Targets → base controller</h3><ol><li data-zh="接收已经解码的 ODOM 目标">Receive already-decoded ODOM targets</li><li data-zh="按轨迹时间顺序更新目标点">Advance targets at the trajectory cadence</li><li data-zh="以高频保持下发当前目标">Maintain the current target at a higher rate</li><li data-zh="执行部分 chunk 后重新观测与推理">Reobserve and replan after part of the chunk</li></ol><code data-zh="当前目标保持 · 实时 ODOM 反馈">Target hold · live ODOM feedback</code></div></div>
+    <div class="cadence-strip"><div><span class="cadence-number">30<span> Hz</span></span><span data-zh="客户端配置的轨迹目标节拍">Configured trajectory target cadence</span></div><div class="cadence-track" aria-hidden="true"><div class="track-label">TARGETS</div><div class="coarse-ticks">│<span>│</span><span>│</span><span>│</span><span>│</span><span>│</span><span>│</span></div><div class="track-label">TARGET HOLD</div><div class="fine-ticks"></div></div><div><span class="cadence-number">250<span> Hz</span></span><span data-zh="客户端配置的目标保持频率">Configured target-hold loop</span></div></div>
+    <p class="deployment-note" data-zh="这些是开发记录中的客户端配置，不代表已测得的推理吞吐或控制性能。上线前仍需核对训练采样间隔、推理延迟和目标时间戳。">These are client settings from the development notes, not measured inference throughput or control performance. Training sample spacing, inference latency, and target timestamps still require alignment.</p>
+    <div class="contract-grid"><article><span class="contract-index">A</span><h3 data-zh="同一个参考时刻">One reference timestamp</h3><p data-zh="解码使用本次观测中的 T₀。推理结束后重读 ODOM，或每步更换参考，都会改变原预测轨迹。">Use T₀ from the input observation. Substituting a newer pose after inference, or changing it per step, changes the predicted trajectory.</p></article><article><span class="contract-index">B</span><h3 data-zh="只转换一次">Exactly one conversion</h3><p data-zh="SE(2) 编码后跳过普通 Joint 相减。服务端已返回绝对目标时，客户端不再进行第二次解码。">Skip generic joint subtraction after SE(2) encoding. When the service returns absolute targets, the client must not decode them again.</p></article><article><span class="contract-index">C</span><h3 data-zh="字段、统计量与接口一致">Matching fields, statistics & frames</h3><p data-zh="固定 chassis 的顺序、米/弧度和轴向；加载与 checkpoint 配套的相对统计量，并明确控制接口使用 ODOM。">Keep chassis order, meters/radians, and axis conventions consistent. Load checkpoint-matched relative statistics and verify the controller's ODOM frame.</p></article></div>
+  </div></section>
