+    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="section-number">05 / <span data-zh="实验记录与验证边界">Evidence & evaluation</span></p><h2 id="evidence-title" data-zh="记录了什么，下一步验证什么。">What the record shows.<br>What comes next.</h2></div><p data-zh="将已记录的训练实验、部署配置与下一步实机评估分开，明确每一项结论的证据范围。">The training record, deployment configuration, and next evaluation steps are kept separate so each claim has a clear scope.</p></div>
