+    <div class="evaluation-next"><span class="eyebrow plain" data-zh="下一步评估">NEXT EVALUATION</span><h3 data-zh="从接口打通，走向可量化的行为验证。">From integration to measurable behavior.</h3><div class="evaluation-item"><span>01</span><div><h4 data-zh="几何与预处理回放">Geometry & preprocessing replay</h4><p data-zh="验证编码/解码往返、90° 朝向、yaw 跨界，以及完整归一化链路。">Check encode/decode round trips, 90° headings, yaw boundaries, and the complete normalization path.</p></div></div><div class="evaluation-item"><span>02</span><div><h4 data-zh="实机跟踪与时间对齐">Robot tracking & timing</h4><p data-zh="记录目标与实测位姿误差、推理延迟，以及 chunk 衔接时的连续性。">Measure target-versus-observed pose error, inference latency, and continuity at chunk transitions.</p></div></div><div class="evaluation-item"><span>03</span><div><h4 data-zh="任务成功率与对照实验">Task success & ablations</h4><p data-zh="在不同初始位置与朝向下重复试验，比较绝对、逐维相对和 SE(2) 相对动作。">Repeat trials across starting poses and compare absolute, element-wise relative, and SE(2) relative actions.</p></div></div><p class="pending-label" data-zh="当前材料未提供量化实机成功率、跟踪误差或上述对照结果。">Quantitative robot success rates, tracking errors, and these ablation results are not provided in the current record.</p></div></div>
